# Normalise line endings in the repository. Without this, git checks text files out with
# CRLF on Windows and LF in the Linux container, so the *same committed prompt file*
# produces two different byte sequences — and therefore two different prompt-cache
# prefixes — between a developer's machine and production. See adapters/prompts.py.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
